SUMMARY:Black Widow: Web of Deceit | Saturday Night
LOCATION:217 Commonwealth Mansion
DESCRIPTION:Category: Holiday\nPrice: $295.00 per person\nStatus: You are C
 onfirmed\nTime: 8 PM – 1 AM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com
 /events/202989\n\nSlip into the camouflage of costume for an evening under
  the ethereal shadows of lacy silk couture…\n\nYou're cordially invited 
 to The ‘Quin’s Annual Halloween Soirée an elegant and entangled tick
 eted affair. \n\nUnder the flicker of flame\, the ‘House will captivate
  with indulgent buffets\, enchanting performances\, and the deceivingly t
 ranslucent jeweled veil - of the spider’s web.\n\nEnsnared? Fall victi
 m.\n\nIn the shadowed corners of the ‘House\, become entangled in buffet
 s of culinary bites\, live-action stations\, passed delicacies\, and venom
 ous cocktails. A dangerous game of hide-and-seek\, spiral the Grand Stairc
 ase lured by live musical performances\, shadowed portraitists\, acrobats\
 , and other-worldly talents...\n\nPerilous vibes take center stage in \n\
 nBondo \n\nwith a Headline DJ Performance from \n\n10:00PM - Midnight\n\
 nIn the spirit of Halloween\, swarm the ‘House.\n\nCreative black tie\, 
 cocktail attire\, or a cleverly crafted costume is essential.  \n\nTicket
 s are exclusively available for purchase through the Member App & Portal b
 eginning September 16th at 10:00AM. Tickets for members and their guests a
 re $295* each. To best accommodate members' varying preferences\, we are 
 delighted to extend a limited allocation of up to 1 guest ticket per membe
 r for Saturday evening's affair.\n\n*Taxes and beverages are not included
  in the ticket price. Beverages will be available for purchase through our
  masterful team of mixologists. \n\nAt this time\, member tickets are sti
 ll available for the Saturday\, October 24th party\, however guest ticket
 s are fully committed in our best efforts to reserve as many tickets as p
 ossible for interested members. Should we have the opportunity to offer an
  extended amount of guest tickets once all members are accounted for\, we 
 will begin offering these to members who have submitted their names to the
  guest waitlist. Please CLICK HERE to submit a request to the Guest Tick
 et Waitlist. \n\n______________________________________________________\n
 \nPlease be aware of these important notices:\n\nCANCELLATION POLICY\nKind
 ly note that tickets are non-refundable and nontransferable once assigned.
 \n\nENTRY\nAll Member and guest tickets purchased\, are linked to the Memb
 er’s profile through the App and Portal and are required for verificatio
 n and entry on these evenings.\n\nGUEST POLICY\nFollowing the regular Memb
 er Policy\, Members must arrive and remain with their guest(s) at all time
 s. Guests must be age 21+. We strongly encourage review of the Members’ 
 Policy to ensure that you and your guest(s) are aware of Club rules.\n\nVA
 LET SERVICES\nValet services will be suspended on the evenings of October 
 23 & 24. Please plan ahead to secure rideshare services or park at the nea
 rest garage in Back Bay. Metered street parking is limited but also availa
 ble.\n\nNO PHOTO POLICY\nPlease be aware that we will offer a photo opport
 unity on these evenings\; however\, the regular Photo Policy will otherwis
 e be in effect and enforced. Those who do not comply with the Privacy Agre
 ement will be asked to leave the Clubhouse in keeping with the standards.\
 n\nThe ’Quin House has contracted professional photographers and videogr
 aphers to capture this event. Any photos or videos distributed through ’
 Quin public channels will be edited to conceal the identities of participa
 ting Members and their guest(s). Photos or videos that reveal Members will
  only be used in Member communication with the authorization of those capt
 ured.\n\nQuestions? Please contact us at halloween@thequin.com.
